{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_149", "type": "agent_message", "text": "I reproduced one reversal issue: the browser’s snackbar offers Undo after deleting the temporary note, but tapping it leaves the list at 4 cards. The separate “Undo Delete Note” menu command restores the note, so the defect is limited to the snackbar action. I’m filing that report, then I’ll finish cleanup."}}
